    {
      "heading": "Add cumin and chestnuts",
      "blocks": [
        "Carefully flip the cabbage steaks. Drizzle over the remaining {{oil-second}} olive oil and sprinkle with {{cumin-seeds}} cumin seeds. Chop the chestnuts and scatter them around the steaks.",
        "Roast for 15–20 minutes, until the edges are crisp, the centres are tender and the chestnuts are lightly browned."
      ],
